-- 1351: Blog post -- "Claude Cowork for Digital Marketing: Reusable Skills and MCP Tools That Cut the Repetitive Work".
-- Focus: MCP integration + custom Claude Skills as the two mechanisms that make AI marketing
-- repeatable rather than ad hoc; includes a worked Skill and performance analysis.
-- Funnels to WSQ Claude Cowork for Digital Marketing (TGS-2023018659), SG-only.
-- Published live (status=1), BACK-DATED to 2025-04-12 per the admin's "date all the digital
-- marketing blogs in Apr to Aug 2025" (post 2 of 16, WSQ/CASL digital marketing batch).
--
-- BACK-DATED => linkedin_urn / facebook_post_id = 'manual-skip' so publishDue's share
-- step permanently no-ops (standing rule, blog-pipeline SKILL.md "Hard-won rules").
--
-- All external + course URLs verified HTTP 200 on 2026-09-07.
--
